  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3007.01 ERCs from RACT Sources. ERCs generated by Generator sources subject to RACT which are transferred to stationary sources subject to RACT shall be transferred in the ratio of 1:1.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
